    note right of VPEngine #FFCDD2:[PENDING] waiting for ETDA | Thai VC ARF 2.0 DRAFT 0\nissue : section 13.7.1 (informative , MUST) and SC-24 : the status_list.uri comes from a source allowed in the Trusted List , the Thai profile has no field for it yet , the engine uses the uri in the credential\nquestion : which Trusted List field lists the allowed status list sources
