Core->Core: [AUDIT LOG] Write audit record of VCVP Core 32\n(EventType = VERIFICATION_RESULT_READ , Actor OFFICER , EngineCalls GET , Correlation.VerificationId) , no claim values

note over Core,VPEngine #khaki: 9.2 VCVP Core deletes the claim values (periodic job)
note right of Core #wheat:[SPEC] VCVP policy : grace period 300 seconds by default after ClaimsDeliveredAt\nif nobody reads the result , the engine deletes the claim values itself at expireDuration (retainUntilDate)
group VCVP Core claim-delete job (periodic)
    Core->Core: Find Verifications rows with ClaimsDeliveredAt older than the grace period and ClaimsDeletedAt null
    loop Each row found
        Core->VPEngine: Delete the claim values | DELETE /api/proof-request/v1/{id}/claims
        alt Deleted
            VPEngine-->Core: 204
            Core->Core: [DATA STORE] Verifications ClaimsDeletedAt
            Core->Core: [AUDIT LOG] Write audit record (EventType = VERIFICATION_CLAIMS_DELETED , Actor SYSTEM , EngineCalls DELETE claims , Correlation.VerificationId)
        else Delete failed
            Core->Core: ClaimsDeletedAt not set , retried on the next run
        end
    end
end

